1️⃣ Order Service APIs
API 1 — Create Order

POST

http://localhost:8081/orders

Body:

{
    "productName": "Laptop",
    "amount": 50000
}

Response:

{
    "id": 1,
    "productName": "Laptop",
    "amount": 50000.0,
    "status": "PAID"
}
What happens?
POST /orders
     ↓
Order created
     ↓
Order Service calls Payment Service
     ↓
Payment SUCCESS
     ↓
Order status = PAID
